            <div xml:id="d551">

                <pb facs="0568" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">352.1121 Fernandez, Antonio/111: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Gibraltar</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Williams</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Gibraltar</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-11-21T10:00:00+00:00">November 21, 1937—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 21—7:35 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Following telegram has been received from Fisher, Palma de Mallorca via British
                    Navy: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“19th Fernandez sentenced 20 years wife 12 years.</p>
                        <p>General state[s] pardon cannot be obtained here. Application for pardon
                            must be made to Burgos. Please advise.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
